{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1469","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. A Bit Similar"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1024 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's call two strings $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ (both of length $$$k$$$) "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a bit similar"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if they have the same character in some position, i. e. there exists at least one $$$i \\in [1, k]$$$ such that $$$a_i = b_i$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a binary string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$ (a string of $$$n$$$ characters "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and/or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":") and an integer $$$k$$$. Let's denote the string $$$s[i..j]$$$ as the substring of $$$s$$$ starting from the $$$i$$$-th character and ending with the $$$j$$$-th character (that is, $$$s[i..j] = s_i s_{i + 1} s_{i + 2} \\dots s_{j - 1} s_j$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's call a binary string $$$t$$$ of length $$$k$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beautiful"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if it is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a bit similar"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" to all substrings of $$$s$$$ having length exactly $$$k$$$; that is, it is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a bit similar"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" to $$$s[1..k], s[2..k+1], \\dots, s[n-k+1..n]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your goal is to find the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"lexicographically"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" smallest string $$$t$$$ that is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beautiful"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", or report that no such string exists. String $$$x$$$ is lexicographically less than string $$$y$$$ if either $$$x$$$ is a prefix of $$$y$$$ (and $$$x \\ne y$$$), or there exists such $$$i$$$ ($$$1 \\le i \\le \\min(|x|, |y|)$$$), that $$$x_i \\lt y_i$$$, and for any $$$j$$$ ($$$1 \\le j \\lt i$$$) $$$x_j = y_j$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le q \\le 10000$$$) — the number of test cases. Each test case consists of two lines."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\le k \\le n \\le 10^6$$$). The second line contains the string $$$s$$$, consisting of $$$n$$$ characters (each character is either "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$10^6$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print the answer as follows:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" if it is impossible to construct a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beautiful"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" string, print one line containing the string "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" (note: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly in upper case"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", you can't print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"No"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", for example); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" otherwise, print two lines. The first line should contain the string "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" (exactly in upper case as well); the second line — the lexicographically smallest "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beautiful"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" string, consisting of $$$k$$$ characters "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and/or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n4 2\n0110\n4 2\n1001\n9 3\n010001110\n9 3\n101110001\n10 3\n0101110001\n10 10\n1111111111\n11 10\n11111111110\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\n11\nYES\n00\nYES\n010\nYES\n101\nNO\nYES\n0000000001\nYES\n0000000010\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1469E"